/**
 * Translation catalogs (Plan §13). English is the source of truth; every other
 * locale is typed as a complete Record of the same keys, so a missing string is
 * a compile error — no silent fallbacks for shipped locales.
 *
 * Keys are flat + dot-namespaced. Values may contain {{var}} interpolation
 * placeholders. Plural keys use the `_one` / `_other` suffix convention and are
 * selected by a `count` variable.
 */

